===== message =====
<div class="quotebox"><blockquote><p>plain quote</p></blockquote></div><div class="quotebox"><cite>Someone wrote:</cite><blockquote><p>attributed quote</p></blockquote></div><div class="quotebox"><cite>Some One wrote:</cite><blockquote><p>quoted attribution with [brackets]</p></blockquote></div>
===== message-errors =====

===== signature =====
</p><div class="quotebox"><blockquote><p>plain quote</p></blockquote></div><p><br /></p><div class="quotebox"><cite>Someone wrote:</cite><blockquote><p>attributed quote</p></blockquote></div><p><br /></p><div class="quotebox"><cite>Some One wrote:</cite><blockquote><p>quoted attribution with [brackets]</p></blockquote></div><p>
===== signature-errors =====
Signature may not contain of the text formatting tags (BBCode) [quote], [code] or [list]. Please choose another tags or delete it.
===== clickable-unicode =====
[quote]plain quote[/quote]
[quote=Someone]attributed quote[/quote]
[quote="Some One"]quoted attribution with [brackets][/quote]
===== clickable-ascii =====
[quote]plain quote[/quote]
[quote=Someone]attributed quote[/quote]
[quote="Some One"]quoted attribution with [brackets][/quote]
